### 5\. DNS filters

| Filter                         | Function                       |
| ------------------------------ | ------------------------------ |
| dns                            | All DNS packets                |
| dns.qry.name                   | Displays DNS query names       |
| dns.flags.response == 0        | DNS queries                    |
| dns.flags.response == 1        | DNS responses                  |
| dns.qry.type == 1              | IPv4 A-record queries          |
| dns.qry.type == 28             | IPv6 AAAA-record queries       |
